msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source docs\nReport-Msgid-Bugs-To: \nLanguage: zh_CN\nLanguage-Team: Nexus agent-reviewed documentation\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nPlural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: c96bc3d140a5a24ef6811c1070be8d175a25ab89bbda886078f606518ad398dd\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\n"

msgid "Source, software evidence and physical qualification"
msgstr "源码、软件证据与物理资格"

msgid "A document describes code; it does not qualify that code merely by being published. A result applies to the exact source, configuration, environment and artifacts that were actually executed. Current document source, described code source and qualified historical code source are separate identities."
msgstr "文档描述代码，发布文档自身不会使代码合格。结果适用于实际执行的精确源码、配置、环境和产物。当前文档源码、所描述代码源码和已合格历史代码源码是独立身份。"

msgid "![Separate Native, ARM, SDK, reproduction and physical evidence](../../assets/diagrams/qualification-evidence.svg)"
msgstr "![独立 Native、ARM、SDK、复现与物理证据](../../assets/diagrams/qualification-evidence.svg)"

msgid "Separate Native, ARM, SDK, reproduction and physical evidence"
msgstr "独立 Native、ARM、SDK、复现与物理证据"

msgid "FIG-11 shows evidence inputs and their independent scope. No arrow turns a model or a workflow into physical measurements."
msgstr "FIG-11 表示证据输入及其独立范围。任何箭头都不会把模型或工作流变成物理测量。"

msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "证据"

msgid "What it can establish"
msgstr "能够建立的结论"

msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制"

msgid "Native/GoogleTest/GoogleMock"
msgstr "Native/GoogleTest/GoogleMock"

msgid "Executed software contracts against selected models/ports"
msgstr "针对选定模型/端口实际执行的软件合同"

msgid "Not physical timing or electrical truth"
msgstr "不是物理时序或电气事实"

msgid "ARM ELF/BIN/map"
msgstr "ARM ELF/BIN/map"

msgid "Actual compile/link, vector, configuration and resource binding"
msgstr "实际编译/链接、vector、配置和资源绑定"

msgid "Not MCU execution"
msgstr "不是 MCU 执行"

msgid "Relocated Source SDK consumer"
msgstr "搬移后的 Source SDK 消费者"

msgid "Public include/ABI closure and actual consumer build/run/link"
msgstr "公共 include/ABI 闭包与实际消费者构建/运行/链接"

msgid "Not product integration or HIL"
msgstr "不是产品集成或 HIL"

msgid "Two fresh offline builds"
msgstr "两次 fresh offline 构建"

msgid "Actual byte comparison in the bound environment"
msgstr "绑定环境内的实际字节比较"

msgid "Not a digest-only or universal reproducibility promise"
msgstr "不是仅有 digest 或普遍可复现承诺"

msgid "Software candidate"
msgstr "软件候选"

msgid "Clean exact scope, identities and retained unsigned artifacts"
msgstr "干净精确范围、身份与保留的无签名产物"

msgid "Not signed product release, safety certification or LTS"
msgstr "不是签名产品发布、安全认证或 LTS"

msgid "Real HIL record"
msgstr "真实 HIL record"

msgid "Observed hardware/workload/instrument scope on one admitted station"
msgstr "一个 admitted station 上观察的硬件/负载/仪器范围"

msgid "Not unobserved loads or arbitrary boards"
msgstr "不是未观察负载或任意板卡"

msgid "Locate actual records"
msgstr "定位实际记录"

msgid "The [delivery index](../../delivery/README.md) retains original results and limitations. The build-system result record binds qualified code `cc6a065c`; its document updates do not inherit those tests to a new HEAD. Earlier SoC extension evidence binds `98270512` independently. Read each linked JSON result and raw receipt for exact full source identity, selected scope, artifact hashes and failed attempts."
msgstr "[交付索引](../../delivery/README.md)保留原始结果和限制。构建系统结果绑定 qualified code `cc6a065c`；后续文档提交不把这些测试继承到新 HEAD。较早 SoC 扩展证据独立绑定 `98270512`。阅读关联 JSON result 和 raw receipt，核对完整精确 source identity、选定 scope、artifact hash 和失败尝试。"

msgid "Current physical MCU records remain `not_executed`: no connected Board station has established clock accuracy, IRQ/DMA timing, Cache behavior, context retention, electrical outputs, Flash power-loss or long-duration performance. Software-reference HIL fixtures cannot be edited into physical qualification."
msgstr "当前 MCU 物理记录保持 `not_executed`：没有已连接 Board station 建立 clock 精度、IRQ/DMA 时序、Cache 行为、上下文保留、电气输出、Flash 掉电或长期性能。不能编辑软件参考 HIL fixture 来建立物理资格。"

msgid "A new implementation must run its applicable gates with fresh nonempty reports. A new documentation-only build may reference old qualified code while explicitly showing that identity; it must not rewrite the old record or reuse test counts as current execution. See the [performance/HIL guide](../../guides/performance-hil.md) and the [build contract](../../design/build-system.md)."
msgstr "新实现必须执行其适用 gate，提供 fresh 非空报告。新的纯文档构建可明确显示身份并引用旧 qualified code，但不得改写旧记录或把旧用例数当成本次执行。见[性能/HIL 指南](../../guides/performance-hil.md)和[构建合同](../../design/build-system.md)。"

